125	## Introduction
126	
127	This guide provides best practices for threat hunting using the ADEO CTI MCP Server tools. Threat hunting is a proactive cybersecurity approach that focuses on searching for malicious activities and threats that have evaded existing security solutions.
128	
129	## Available Tools for Threat Hunters
130	
131	### Reconnaissance & Intelligence Gathering
132	
133	1. **DNS Lookup** (dns-lookup)
134	   - Use this tool to resolve domain names to IP addresses
135	   - Helpful for identifying infrastructure connected to suspicious domains
136	   - Example: Investigating domains from phishing emails or suspicious communications
137	
138	2. **Reverse DNS** (reverse-dns)
