173	   - Helps in refining and optimizing complex searches
174	
175	### Monitoring & Alerting
176	
177	1. **Create Alert** (create-alert)
178	   - Set up continuous monitoring for new threats or vulnerabilities
179	   - Get notified when new systems matching your criteria appear
180	   - Essential for ongoing threat hunting operations
181	
182	2. **List/Get/Delete Alerts** (list-alerts, get-alert-info, delete-alert)
183	   - Manage your monitoring operations
184	   - Review and refine your alert criteria
185	
186	### Malware Analysis
187	
188	1. **VirusTotal URL Analysis** (vt-url-analysis)
189	   - Check if URLs are associated with malicious activities
190	   - View detailed reports from multiple security engines
191	   - Perfect for validating suspicious links
192	
193	2. **VirusTotal File Analysis** (vt-file-analysis)
194	   - Analyze suspicious files for malware signatures
195	   - Get comprehensive reports from multiple antivirus engines
196	   - Essential for malware investigation
197	
198	3. **VirusTotal Domain/IP Analysis** (vt-domain-analysis, vt-ip-analysis)
199	   - Investigate domains and IPs for malicious associations
