202	
203	## Workflow Examples
204	
205	### Investigating a Suspicious Domain
206	
207	1. Start with dns-lookup to find associated IP addresses
208	2. Use host-info on those IPs to identify services and vulnerabilities
209	3. Check domain reputation with vt-domain-analysis
210	4. Set up an alert to monitor for changes
211	
212	### Proactive Vulnerability Scanning
213	
214	1. Use search-host with specific vulnerability filters
215	2. Investigate interesting findings with host-info
216	3. Look up specific vulnerabilities with cve-lookup
217	4. Monitor critical assets with create-alert
218	
219	### Malware Campaign Analysis
220	
221	1. Analyze suspicious URLs with vt-url-analysis
